    "updated_at": "2025-09-02T09:14:49Z",
    "body": "No, auto-sizing still happens. We also don't update `window.length` or allow the `object` to be targeted by links.\n\nTesting with https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/14032 it seems WebKit and Chromium now create a normal browsing context, 300x150, and allow link targeting.\n\nSo we can [simplify in Gecko](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1986397). @farre worked hard to make auto-sizing work and prevent link targeting, but it is what it is. :)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
