    "updated_at": "2025-09-04T00:57:48Z",
    "body": "I think auto-sizing in Chromium might be dependent on the file extension in the URL... another reason these elements are terrible.\n\n- https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=14039\n- https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=14040\n- https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=14041\n\nI believe the code path is [this layout-adjacent code](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_plugin_element.cc;l=356;drc=eacc76afbe1d2a055571fc8f66ab67d17530956c;bpv=1;bpt=1) which bottoms out in [this MIME type from URL code](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/html_plugin_element.cc;drc=eacc76afbe1d2a055571fc8f66ab67d17530956c;bpv=1;bpt=1;l=76).",
